>\\n<li>Casamentos</li>\\n<li>Aniversários</li>\\n<li>Bar/bat mitzvah</li>\\n<li>Bodas</li>\\n<li>Festa de Debutante</li>\\n<li>Eventos Corporativos</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>[divider height=\\\"30\\\"] [button title=\\\"Galeria de Eventos Realizados\\\" link=\\\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/gallery/\\\" align=\\\"\\\" icon=\\\"\\\" icon_position=\\\"\\\" color=\\\"theme\\\" font_color=\\\"\\\" size=\\\"2\\\" full_width=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"\\\" download=\\\"\\\" rel=\\\"\\\" onclick=\\\"\\\"]</p>\",\"align\":\"\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"w4os3kjvb\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"wlkgu2vm8\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"50\",\"padding_bottom\":\"10\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\" equal-height-wrap\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"64\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"7993b3695\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading\",\"content\":\"<h2>O Espaço Coimbra, possui tudo para transformar o seu evento em um momento único.</h2>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"0746e3bd6\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"image\",\"uid\":\"32b641c90\",\"attr\":{\"src\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/teste2.fw_.png#126\",\"size\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\",\"stretch\":\"0\",\"border\":\"0\",\"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"99b667fe8\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h3>Cardápios Versáteis</h3>\\n<p>Cardápios versáteis e criativos que se adaptam ao perfil da sua celebração. Experimente a gastronomia exclusiva e altamente qualificada do nosso buffet para casamentos e eventos.</p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"a61b18e0c\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"image\",\"uid\":\"5ea38f0ad\",\"attr\":{\"src\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/teste.fw_-1.png#125\",\"size\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\",\"stretch\":\"0\",\"border\":\"0\",\"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"d557af949\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h3>Infraestrutura Completa</h3>\\n<p>Na locação do Espaço Coimbra, você tem acesso a uma infraestrutura completa com dois salões, palco, cozinha equipada, toaletes de alto padrão e muito mais para até 300 pessoas.</p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"b2af4366c\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"image\",\"uid\":\"dbfa6ef04\",\"attr\":{\"src\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/capela2.fw_.png#124\",\"size\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\",\"stretch\":\"0\",\"border\":\"0\",\"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"c2bd382ac\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h3>Espaço Ecumênico e VIP</h3>\\n<p>Aproveite nossa capela ecumênica para cerimônias e a sala VIP para anfitriões, garantindo um ambiente exclusivo e confortável para seu evento especial.</p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"55561130e\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"button\",\"uid\":\"5bb48ccf1\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Clique aqui e faça um orçamento para o seu evento conosco!\",\"link\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/contact/\",\"target\":\"0\",\"align\":\"center\",\"icon\":\"icon-right-open\",\"icon_position\":\"right\",\"color\":\"theme\",\"font_color\":\"\",\"size\":\"2\",\"full_width\":\"0\",\"class\":\"\",\"rel\":\"\",\"download\":\"\",\"onclick\":\"\",\"css_button_background_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"background-color\"}}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"82d3a4c27\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"cb11a9eae\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"#edd9d5\",\"bg_image\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_bgsection1.png\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"70\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"64\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"uo4qksbuif\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\\\">\\n<h2>Gastronomia</h2>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"c2012b64-13de-4855-ab01-1d5dd92d058c\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\\\">\\n<p>A gastronomia do Espaço Coimbra é uma celebração de sabores e criatividade, oferecendo cardápios versáteis que se adaptam perfeitamente ao perfil de cada evento. Com uma equipe de chefs talentosos e dedicados, nossos menus são elaborados para encantar todos os paladares, combinando ingredientes frescos e de alta qualidade para criar pratos deliciosos e visualmente deslumbrantes. Seja para casamentos, aniversários ou eventos corporativos, nossa gastronomia proporciona uma experiência culinária inesquecível que complementa a atmosfera única do nosso espaço.</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"image_gallery\",\"uid\":\"0slqka6e\",\"attr\":{\"columns\":\"4\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"style\":\"masonry\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"classes\":\"\",\"css_galleryimage_frame_border_style\":{\"val\":\"dashed\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .gallery .image_frame\",\"css_style\":\"border-style\"},\"ids\":\"108,109,110,111,112,113,114,115\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"button\",\"uid\":\"38bde42f2\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Clique aqui e faça um orçamento para o seu evento conosco!\",\"link\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/contact/\",\"target\":\"0\",\"align\":\"center\",\"icon\":\"icon-right-open\",\"icon_position\":\"right\",\"color\":\"theme\",\"font_color\":\"\",\"size\":\"2\",\"full_width\":\"0\",\"class\":\"\",\"rel\":\"\",\"download\":\"\",\"onclick\":\"\",\"css_button_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"color\"},\"css_button_background_color\":{\"val\":\"#000000\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"background-color\"},\"css_button_icon_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button i\",\"css_style\":\"color\"}}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"ea972e547\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"6631f321e\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"70\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"section-border-top\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"64\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\",\"css_shape_divider_top_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section-mfnuidelement .mfn-shape-divider-top svg\",\"css_style\":\"--mfn-shape-divider\"}}},{\"type\":\"column\",\"size\":\"1/1\",\"uid\":\"tfcuevzd\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\\\">\\n<h2>Orçamento</h2>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"c2012b64-13de-4855-ab01-1d5dd92d058c\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\\\">\\n<p>Preencha os campos abaixo para obter um orçamento sem compromisso do Espaço Coimbra!</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"},\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"title\":\"Column\",\"icon\":\"column\",\"used_fonts\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"cf7\",\"jsclass\":\"cf7\",\"title\":\"Contact Form 7\",\"icon\":\"cf7\",\"uid\":\"7j016pqqw\",\"size\":\"1/1\",\"tablet_size\":\"1/1\",\"laptop_size\":\"1/1\",\"mobile_size\":\"1/1\",\"tablet_resized\":\"0\",\"attr\":{\"form\":\"116\",\"custom_css\":\"<style>\\n.wpcf7-form .form-row {\\n  display: flex;\\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group {\\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .half-width {\\n  flex: 1;\\n  min-width: calc(50% - 15px);\\n  margin-right: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .half-width:last-child {\\n  margin-right: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .full-width {\\n  flex: 1;\\n  width: 100%;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group label {\\n  display: block;\\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"text\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"email\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"tel\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"number\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-for