"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"c2bd382ac\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h3>Espaço Ecumênico e VIP</h3>\\n<p>Aproveite nossa capela ecumênica para cerimônias e a sala VIP para anfitriões, garantindo um ambiente exclusivo e confortável para seu evento especial.</p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"55561130e\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"button\",\"uid\":\"5bb48ccf1\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Clique aqui e faça um orçamento para o seu evento conosco!\",\"link\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/about-us/\",\"target\":\"0\",\"align\":\"center\",\"icon\":\"icon-right-open\",\"icon_position\":\"right\",\"color\":\"theme\",\"font_color\":\"\",\"size\":\"2\",\"full_width\":\"0\",\"class\":\"\",\"rel\":\"\",\"download\":\"\",\"onclick\":\"\",\"css_button_background_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"background-color\"}}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"82d3a4c27\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"cb11a9eae\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"#edd9d5\",\"bg_image\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_bgsection1.png\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"70\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"64\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"uo4qksbuif\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\\\">\\n<h2>Gastronomia</h2>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"c2012b64-13de-4855-ab01-1d5dd92d058c\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\\\">\\n<p>A gastronomia do Espaço Coimbra é uma celebração de sabores e criatividade, oferecendo cardápios versáteis que se adaptam perfeitamente ao perfil de cada evento. Com uma equipe de chefs talentosos e dedicados, nossos menus são elaborados para encantar todos os paladares, combinando ingredientes frescos e de alta qualidade para criar pratos deliciosos e visualmente deslumbrantes. Seja para casamentos, aniversários ou eventos corporativos, nossa gastronomia proporciona uma experiência culinária inesquecível que complementa a atmosfera única do nosso espaço.</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"image_gallery\",\"uid\":\"0slqka6e\",\"attr\":{\"columns\":\"4\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"style\":\"masonry\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"classes\":\"\",\"css_galleryimage_frame_border_style\":{\"val\":\"dashed\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .gallery .image_frame\",\"css_style\":\"border-style\"},\"ids\":\"108