(690, 212, 'mfn-page-object', '[{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"c6055a766\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Bem vindo ao Espaço Coimbra Garden</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">[divider height=\\\"20\\\"]</p>\\n<p>O Espaço Coimbra Garden é um verdadeiro paraíso ao ar livre, ideal para eventos que buscam uma integração harmoniosa com a natureza. Com jardins exuberantes e paisagens deslumbrantes, nosso espaço proporciona um cenário perfeito para casamentos, aniversários, festas de debutante e eventos corporativos.</p>\\n<p>Cercado por uma vegetação exuberante e vistas panorâmicas, o Espaço Coimbra Garden oferece um ambiente elegante e tranquilo. O salão principal se integra perfeitamente com a natureza ao redor, criando uma atmosfera serena e sofisticada. Cada evento realizado aqui se torna uma experiência única e memorável.</p>\",\"align\":\"\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"5eb72bdbd\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"85111b8b5\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"50\",\"padding_bottom\":\"10\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\" equal-height-wrap\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"132\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"image\",\"uid\":\"53y24u9yf\",\"attr\":{\"src\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/DJI_0375-scaled.jpg#75\",\"size\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\",\"stretch\":\"0\",\"border\":\"0\",\"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"image\",\"uid\":\"ebhg60up\",\"attr\":{\"src\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/DSC00321-scaled.jpg#81\",\"size\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\",\"stretch\":\"0\",\"border\":\"0\",\"margin\":\"\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"link_image\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":\"0\",\"hover\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"0nmbhh9kn\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"dp91ge4kw\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Infraestrutura</h2>\\n<p>[divider height=\\\"20\\\"]</p>\\n<p>O Espaço Coimbra Garden não é apenas bonito, mas também funcional. Nossa infraestrutura inclui:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Jardins Exuberantes:</strong> Perfeitos para cerimônias ao ar livre, coquetéis e recepções, oferecendo um ambiente natural e encantador.</li>\\n<li><strong>Salão Principal:</strong> Com capacidade para até 300 pessoas, o salão principal é ideal para celebrações que combinam a sofisticação de um ambiente interno com a beleza natural do exterior.</li>\\n<li><strong>Cozinha Equipada:</strong> Nossa cozinha é totalmente equipada, permitindo que nossos chefs preparem pratos deliciosos diretamente no local.</li>\\n<li><strong>Palco para Apresentações:</strong> Ideal para discursos, apresentações musicais e outras formas de entretenimento.</li>\\n<li><strong>Toaletes de Alto Padrão:</strong> Garantindo conforto e conveniência para todos os convidados.</li>\\n<li><strong>Capela Ecumênica:</strong> Um espaço acolhedor para cerimônias religiosas ou momentos de reflexão.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>[divider height=\\\"30\\\"] [button title=\\\"Galeria de Eventos Realizados\\\" link=\\\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/dresses/\\\" align=\\\"\\\" icon=\\\"\\\" icon_position=\\\"\\\" color=\\\"theme\\\" font_color=\\\"\\\" size=\\\"2\\\" full_width=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"\\\" download=\\\"\\\" rel=\\\"\\\" onclick=\\\"\\\"]</p>\",\"align\":\"\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"w4os3kjvb\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"cb11a9eae\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"#edd9d5\",\"bg_image\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_bgsection1.png\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"70\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"132\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"uo4qksbuif\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\\\">\\n<h2><span style=\\\"letter-spacing: 0px;\\\">Galeria de Fotos</span></h2>\\n</div>\\n</div>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"image_gallery\",\"uid\":\"0slqka6e\",\"attr\":{\"columns\":\"4\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"style\":\"masonry\",\"greyscale\":\"0\",\"classes\":\"\",\"css_galleryimage_frame_border_style\":{\"val\":\"dashed\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .gallery .image_frame\",\"css_style\":\"border-style\"},\"ids\":\"89,86,85,84,83,82,79,78,77,80,76,75,81,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"button\",\"uid\":\"38bde42f2\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Clique aqui e veja mais Eventos Realizados pelo Espaço Coimbra!\",\"link\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/gallery/\",\"target\":\"0\",\"align\":\"center\",\"icon\":\"icon-right-open\",\"icon_position\":\"right\",\"color\":\"theme\",\"font_color\":\"\",\"size\":\"2\",\"full_width\":\"0\",\"class\":\"\",\"rel\":\"\",\"download\":\"\",\"onclick\":\"\",\"css_button_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"color\"},\"css_button_background_color\":{\"val\":\"#000000\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button\",\"css_style\":\"background-color\"},\"css_button_icon_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button i\",\"css_style\":\"color\"}}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"ea972e547\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"6631f321e\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"70\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"section-border-top\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"132\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\",\"css_shape_divider_top_color\":{\"val\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"css_path\":\".mcb-section-mfnuidelement .mfn-shape-divider-top svg\",\"css_style\":\"--mfn-shape-divider\"}}},{\"type\":\"column\",\"size\":\"1/1\",\"uid\":\"tfcuevzd\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\\\">\\n<h2>Orçamento</h2>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"c2012b64-13de-4855-ab01-1d5dd92d058c\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\\\">\\n<p>Preencha os campos abaixo para obter um orçamento sem compromisso do Espaço Coimbra!</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"},\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"title\":\"Column\",\"icon\":\"column\",\"used_fonts\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"cf7\",\"jsclass\":\"cf7\",\"title\":\"Contact Form 7\",\"icon\":\"cf7\",\"uid\":\"7j016pqqw\",\"size\":\"1/1\",\"tablet_size\":\"1/1\",\"laptop_size\":\"1/1\",\"mobile_size\":\"1/1\",\"tablet_resized\":\"0\",\"attr\":{\"form\":\"116\",\"custom_css\":\"<style>\\n.wpcf7-form .form-row {\\n  display: flex;\\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group {\\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .half-width {\\n  flex: 1;\\n  min-width: calc(50% - 15px);\\n  margin-right: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .half-width:last-child {\\n  margin-right: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .full-width {\\n  flex: 1;\\n  width: 100%;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group label {\\n  display: block;\\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"text\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"email\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"tel\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"number\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group input[type=\\\"date\\\"],\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group textarea,\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group select {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  padding: 8px;\\n  border: 1px solid #ccc;\\n  border-radius: 4px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form .form-group p {\\n  margin: 0 0 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.wpcf7-form p {\\n  text-align: center;\\n}\\n</style>\\n\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"fc79w1wzf\",\"attr\":{\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"move_up\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"column_margin\":\"\",\"vertical_align\":\"top\",\"class\":\"\",\"sticky\":\"0\",\"sticky_tablet\":\"0\",\"sticky_mobile\":\"0\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"e6245ab82\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"a4cfc9537\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"#edd9d5\",\"bg_image\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_bgsection2.png\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;center top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"110\",\"padding_bottom\":\"270\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"section-border-top\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"\",\"vb_postid\":\"132\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"hover_box\",\"uid\":\"374c4c103\",\"attr\":{\"image\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_pic12a.png\",\"image_hover\":\"https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/home_weddingdresses_pic12b.png\",\"link\":\"https://youtu.be/D3Mgfyfl31M?si=3URmtEHqhgK0yCDo\",\"target\":\"lightbox\",\"classes\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"column\",\"uid\":\"ccd22b716\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"Heading + desc\",\"content\":\"<h6 style=\\\"color: #fff;\\\">ASSISTA AO VÍDEO</h6>\\n<h2 style=\\\"color: #fff;\\\">Momento eternizado pela produtora 4 Estações</h2>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"align-mobile\":\"\",\"column_bg\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"margin_bottom\":\"\",\"padding\":\"\",\"animate\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"style\":\"\"}},{\"jsclass\":\"wrap\",\"uid\":\"25a00da23\",\"attr\":{}},{\"jsclass\":\"section\",\"uid\":\"7b2dfe37f\",\"attr\":{\"title\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"bg_image\":\"\",\"bg_position\":\"no-repeat;left top;;\",\"bg_size\":\"auto\",\"bg_video_mp4\":\"\",\"bg_video_ogv\":\"\",\"padding_top\":\"0\",\"padding_bottom\":\"110\",\"divider\":\"\",\"decor_top\":\"\",\"decor_bottom\":\"\",\"navigation\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"class\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"visibility\":\"\",\"hide\":\"1\",\"vb_postid\":\"132\",\"vb\":1,\"rwd\":\"desktop\"}}]'),
