r entered code is incorrect.\nThe e-mail address entered is invalid.\nThe URL is invalid.\nThe telephone number is invalid.', 'Contact Form', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'contact-form', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'https://espacocoimbra.com.br/home-page/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&p=51', 0, 'wpcf7_contact_form', '', 0),
